[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0967","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0967.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0842","title":"SCO UnixWare scohelphttp 目录遍历任意文件读取漏洞","description":"UnixWare 7 的 scohelphttp Web 服务器中 search97cgi/vtopic 组件存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过构造包含 `..`（点点）序列的恶意 HTTP 请求，突破路径限制读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 UnixWare 7 系列版本，攻击复杂度低，仅需网络可达即可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0842"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:34Z","remediation":"UnixWare 7 已停止维护，官方不再提供安全更新。建议立即禁用 scohelphttp 服务（`/etc/rc2.d/S99scohelp stop && chkconfig scohelphttp off`），或在 inetd 配置中注释掉相关行后重启 inetd。如业务必须使用，应在网络边界防火墙封禁对 457/TCP 端口的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接，并迁移至受支持的 Web 服务器（如 Apache）替代。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0086.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1663","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0842.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0842.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0842","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0842.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0842.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0842.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3e2d7833ca42f41a6bb2e84d7adeb5471252536d/2000/CVE-2000-0842.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0842.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0842.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0842.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0967.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0966","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0966.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0839","title":"Ipswitch WinCOM LPD 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Ipswitch WinCOM LPD 1.00.90 的 LPD 服务组件存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标系统的 LPD 端口（515）发送大量特制的 LPD 选项数据包，导致服务进程资源耗尽或崩溃，从而造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 WinCOM LPD 1.00.90 版本，攻击者只需具备网络访问能力即可实施攻击，利用难度较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0839"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:34Z","remediation":"升级 Ipswitch WinCOM LPD 至 1.00.90 以上版本（如厂商已停止支持，建议迁移至现代打印服务方案）。在防火墙层面限制对 TCP 端口 515 的访问，仅允许受信任的打印客户端 IP。如无需远程打印功能，直接禁用 LPD 服务以彻底消除攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0212.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1701","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5258","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2000/CVE-2000-0839.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0839.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0839.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0839","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0839.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0839.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0839.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d