nt VPN-1/FireWall-1 4.1 及更早版本存在 FTP 连接强制绕过漏洞（FTP Bounce）。远程攻击者可通过向防火墙发送特制的无效 FTP 命令，利用防火墙对 FTP 协议处理不当的缺陷，将 FTP 连接重定向至第三方服务器，从而绕过防火墙访问控制策略。该漏洞允许攻击者利用受影响的防火墙作为跳板扫描内网或攻击其他目标，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。厂商已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0813"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:32Z","remediation":"升级 Check Point VPN-1/FireWall-1 至 4.1 SP2 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，可在防火墙策略中禁用 FTP 协议的安全检查（将 FTP Security Server 设为 None），或改用 FTPS/SFTP 替代明文 FTP 协议。同时建议在防火墙上配置严格出站规则，限制内部服务器主动发起外部连接的能力。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.checkpoint.com/techsupport/alerts/list_vun.html#FTP_Connection","http://www.osvdb.org/4434","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5474","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0813.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0813.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0813","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0813.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0813.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/963f7056505b7264e8baa3ce879232850f792056/2000/CVE-2000-0813.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0813.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0813.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0813.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0813.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0960.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0957","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0957.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0809","title":"Check Point VPN-1/FireWall-1 协议检查器缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Check Point VPN-1/FireWall-1 4.1 及更早版本的模块间通信机制中的协议检查器 Getkey 函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络向目标系统发送特制的恶意数据包，触发缓冲区溢出，导致防火墙服务崩溃或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Check Point VPN-1/FireWall-1 4.1 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。厂商已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0809"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:31Z","remediation":"升级 Check Point VPN-1/FireWall-1 至 4.1 以上已修复版本（如 4.1 SP2 或更高），该漏洞在 Getkey 协议检查器组件中存在缓冲区溢出，远程攻击者可发送特制数据包触发拒绝服务。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙上配置访问控制规则，限制不可信 IP 对 VPN-1/FireWall-1 管理通信端口的访问，并禁用不必要的协议检查模块以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.checkpoint.com/techsupport/alerts/list_vun.html#Getkey_Buffer","http://www.osvdb.org/4422","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5139","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a4cc8a55779a13aab23d5f0d0cd6e52496b071eb/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0809.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0809.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0809","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0809.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0809.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6c0593e61f0f414ea233c11da6523481203bd9cf/2000/CVE-2000-0809.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0809.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0809.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0809.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0809.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0957.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0956","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0956.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0808","title":"Check Point VPN-1/FireWall-1 认证绕过漏洞","description":"Check Point VPN-1 和 FireWall-1 4.1 及更早版本的模块间 S/Key 身份验证机制在种子生成过程中存在缺陷。远程攻击者可以通过针对一次性密码（s/key）进行暴力破解攻击，从而绕过身份验证机制。该漏洞允许未经授权的远程攻击者在无需合法凭据的情况下进入系统，导致机密数据泄露或系统控制权被非法获取。影响范围涵盖所有使用该认证机制的 4.1 及以下版本产品。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0808"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:31Z","remediation":"建议将 Check Point VPN-1/FireWall-1 升级至 4.2 或更高版本，以修复 S/Key 认证机制的种子生成漏洞。若无法立即升级，应在配置中禁用 S/Key 一次性密码认证，改用更强的多因素认证（MFA）或证书认证方式。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.checkpoint.com/techsupport/alerts/list_vun.html#One-time_Password","http://www.osvdb.org/4421","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5137","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a4cc8a55779a13aab23d5f0d0cd6e52496b071eb/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0808.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0808.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0808","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0808.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0808.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/94c592af9de75672e76fb3f273444726c40342a0/2000/CVE-2000-0808.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0808.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0808.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0808.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0808.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0956.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0955","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0955.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0807","title":"Check Point VPN-1/FireWall-1 OPSEC 身份认证欺骗漏洞","description":"Check Point VPN-1/FireWall-1 4.1 及更早版本中的 OPSEC 通信认证机制（fwn1）存在认证绕过漏洞，未经身份验证的远程攻击者可通过伪造 OPSEC 协议报文欺骗目标系统，冒充合法的 OPSEC 客户端与防火墙管理服务器建立连接，进而绕过身份认证流程。该漏洞影响部署有受影响版本 Check Point 防火墙产品的网络环境，攻击者仅需能够访问目标设备的 OPSEC 通信端口即可发起利用，无需任何凭据，利用复杂度低。成功利用后，攻击者可获取防火墙敏感配置信息、篡改安全策略或控制网络访问规则，导致网络边界防护被绕过。Check Point 已在后续版本中修复此漏洞，建议升级至安全版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0807"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:31Z","remediation":"建议将 Check Point VPN-1/FireWall-1 升级至 4.1 之后的安全补丁版本，或直接升级到更高主版本的防火墙系统以修复 OPSEC 身份验证机制缺陷。如无法立即升级，应通过严格的防火墙访问控制列表 (ACL) 限制对相关端口的外部访问，以降低欺骗攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.checkpoint.com/techsupport/alerts/list_vun.html#OPSEC_Authentication","http://www.osvdb.org/4420","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5471","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/38590de6b24a9e23ae9a8ab63556f3ebbcbcf955/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0807.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/908f27ce56b05b89bd69be9a1ba710270fd64008/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0807.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0807","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0807.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0807.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7ca72f8b280c50be359cf5a3469c32f4f075a09e/2000/CVE-2000-0807.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/6ffe41ed17f28a5cc4ca179538df7b0072158276/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0807.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0807.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0807.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0807.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0955.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0954","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0954.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0806","title":"Check Point FireWall-1 跨模块认证机制拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Check Point FireWall-1/VPN-1 4.1 及更早版本中的模块间认证机制（fwa1）存在设计缺陷，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送特制的网络数据包绕过该认证机制，干扰防火墙各内部模块之间的正常通信，从而触发拒绝服务（Denial of Service）攻击，使防火墙服务崩溃或无法正常处理网络流量。该漏洞影响 Check Point FireWall-1 3.0、4.0、4.1 及同系列的 VPN-1 产品，CVSS v2 评分为 5.0（Medium），CVSS v3 评分为 7.5（High）。攻击者无需任何身份凭据，仅需在目标网络可达的情况下发送恶意数据包即可利用该漏洞，攻击复杂度低，成功后可导致防火墙功能中断，影响企业网络边界的安全防护能力。Check Point 已在安全公告中说明修复方案，建议受影响用户升级至最新版本并应用安全补丁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0806"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:31Z","remediation":"升级 Check Point FireWall-1/VPN-1 至 4.1 SP4 或更高版本，包括 FireWall-1 NG 及后续版本，以修复 fwa1 模块间身份验证绕过漏洞。如无法立即升级，应在防火墙上过滤外部对 fwa1 服务端口的访问，限制 fwa1 仅接受来自受信任管理服务器的通信，并在边界设备上部署 IDS/IPS 规则检测针对 fwa1 的异常数据包。临时缓解期间应持续监控防火墙日志中是否存在 fwa1 相关异常连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.checkpoint.com/techsupport/alerts/list_vun.html#Inter-module_Communications","http://www.osvdb.org/4413","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5162","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/14587a553af4d49d5605e1beebb7fda4e5c12c66/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0806.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f8f41b3c8a1114b748f2f7bb00dbfa68417789/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0806.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0806","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0806.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0806.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/06f2f9a47baa9a6d26014b1cc43fd2ec49d23a26/2000/CVE-2000-0806.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/cdcaa3368ea2911e69a829c314f32734dd72a3b6/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0806.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0806.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0806.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0806.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0954.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0953","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0953.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0805","title":"Check Point VPN-1/FireWall-1 安全绕过漏洞","description":"Check Point VPN-1/FireWall-1 4.1及更早版本存在安全绕过漏洞，该产品在处理封装FWS数据包时未对数据包来源进行充分验证，即使数据包不来自合法的FWZ客户端也会进行重传转发。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可利用此\"封装数据包重传\"机制发送特制数据包，绕过防火墙的安全访问控制策略，可能导致未授权访问受保护的内部网络资源。该漏洞影响Check Point VPN-1/FireWall-1 4.1及更早版本，攻击复杂度低，CVSS评分为7.5，危害等级为高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0805"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:31Z","remediation":"立即将 Check Point VPN-1/FireWall-1 升级至 4.1 Service Pack 1 或更高版本，该补丁修复了对外封装 FWS 数据包的不当重传漏洞。如暂时无法升级，可在防火墙规则中禁用 FWZ 协议的封装修正功能，并限制外部对 VPN-1/FireWall-1 管理接口的访问，仅允许受信任的管理终端连接。建议联系 Check Point 技术支持获取针对 4.1 版的专用补丁包并进行完整性验证。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.checkpoint.com/techsupport/alerts/list_vun.html#Retransmission_of","http://www.osvdb.org/4415","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5469","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c5e4706a6f93aee327d22a13e10aa3342dbdb394/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0805.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/aba6897d631ff42fcc032e2f13044e7ab4f4b566/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0805.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0805","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0805.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0805.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/84f0ff054abc50c6ac501c87c97efb535bd04f2b/2000/CVE-2000-0805.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3c0a490608ca17c3d69b79ce869ff75fd09d0274/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0805.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0805.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0805.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0805.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0953.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0952","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0952.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0804","title":"Check Point VPN-1/FireWall-1 安全绕过漏洞","description":"Check Point VPN-1/FireWall-1 4.1 及更早版本存在安全绕过漏洞，远程攻击者可绕过防火墙的连接方向性检查机制。具体而言，攻击者通过发送分片的 TCP 连接请求或重新打开已关闭的 TCP 连接请求，可欺骗防火墙使其认为该出站连接是由内部主机发起的，从而绕过 \"单向连接强制\" 安全规则，建立未经授权的到内部网络的连接。该漏洞影响所有部署受影响版本的企业边界防护设备，攻击者无需身份认证即可在任意网络位置发起利用，导致部分内部信息泄露及未授权访问。CVSS v2 评分为 7.5（高危），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需认证，对机密性、完整性和可用性均造成部分影响。Check Point 已在官方安全公告中发布修复建议。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0804"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:30Z","remediation":"立即升级 Check Point FireWall-1 至 4.1 SP2 或更高版本，或升级至 FireWall-1 Next Generation (NG)。如暂时无法升级，请在防火墙策略中添加规则拒绝所有 IP 分片数据包（在 SmartDashboard 的规则中设置 IP 分片匹配条件为拒绝），并在内核参数中设置 fw ctl set int fwenforce_oneway_check 1 强制启用单向连接检测，同时确保防火墥墙不在半透明模式下运行。重启防火墙服务后通过 fw ctl zdebug drop 命令验证分片数据包是否被正确丢弃。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.checkpoint.com/techsupport/alerts/list_vun.html#One-way_Connection","http://www.osvdb.org/4419","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5468","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/641f3970fd5f39f90ce01ced252de78bae9ecebe/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0804.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/43b3566a7a8a36e5b72f371cb23799b1115f7f78/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0804.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0804","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0804.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0804.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c22f4d895bb96cc596a627af8280a63e96ae16cd/2000/CVE-2000-0804.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/99a2d0f359c44d8b27ea5e35eaa72ec2eb0f3016/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0804.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0804.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0804.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0804.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0952.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0899","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0899.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0867","title":"Linux klogd 内核日志守护进程格式化字符串本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux 内核日志守护进程 klogd 存在格式字符串漏洞。klogd 在记录内核日志消息时未能正确清理用户注入的格式字符串，当本地攻击者通过触发特定的畸形内核消息，使 klogd 将攻击者可控的数据作为 printf 风格的格式化字符串进行处理时，可利用格式字符串漏洞控制栈/寄存器并进行任意内存读写，从而以 root 权限执行任意代码，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞需本地用户具备触发内核消息的能力方可利用，无需远程访问（CVSS 向量 AV:L），但一旦利用成功即可完全控制系统，危害较大，影响主流 Linux 发行版。修复建议为升级至修复该问题的 klogd 版本并启用相关补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0867"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:38Z","remediation":"建议立即升级系统日志守护进程 klogd（syslog 套件）至 1.3 及以后版本，该版本已在日志输出时对 % 等格式化字符进行安全过滤（sanitize），从根源消除格式字符串注入，并同步更新内核至官方修复后版本。若无法立即升级，可临时限制本地普通用户向内核产生畸形消息的途径（如收紧内核模块加载与驱动调试的访问权限）、去除 klogd 的 SUID 权限并以非特权用户运行，降低本地提权风险；同时开启系统审计，监控以 root 运行的 klogd 进程异常行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0193.html","http://frontal2.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2000:050","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97726239017741&w=2","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/adv9_draht_syslogd_txt.html","http://www.osvdb.org/5824","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-061.html","http://www.turbolinux.com/pipermail/tl-security-announce/2000-September/000023.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5259","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2000/CVE-2000-0867.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0867.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-0867.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0867","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0867.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0867.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0867.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2000/CVE-2000-0867.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a0a14ea0f3a80067c6bf2249ad236215b48e4418/2000/CVE-2000-0867.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/918ac66f0b50ab0d2a013bdf692688d3c0abefbc/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0867.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0899.toml"}]